      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1040431a723425a0",
      "translationZh": "PLaMo-3 分词器在运行 Unigram DP 之前会插入硬边界",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa999552f3d8d03e",
      "translationZh": "在类似于 <|plamo:...|> 的文本周围，以及在至少 4 个连续的",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49c799e37c13bdf4",
      "translationZh": "相同字符或 2 个空格周围。如果没有这些边界，llama.cpp 对代码",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c439862723feac3d",
      "translationZh": "缩进和重复标点的分词方式将与参考实现不同。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff100ca8d9848da",
      "translationZh": "通过独立编码每个分段，来复现 llm_tokenizer_plamo2 中的两次 re.sub() 过程。",
